<title>USA: Johnson&amp; Johnson gains FTC nod on Innotech.</title>
<headline>Johnson&amp; Johnson gains FTC nod on Innotech.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson &amp; Johnson on Friday said the Federal Trade Commission granted an early termination of the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Act with respect to its tender offer for Innotech Inc.</p>
<p>On February 11, Johnson &amp; Johnson said it would acquire Innotech's nine million outstanding shares for $13.75 each cash. The offer is scheduled to expire at midnight, March 17, EST.</p>
